    "number": 56,
    "title": "Adopt shared guide planning and delivery checkpoints",
    "body": "## Change\n\nAdopt the shared guide checkpoints for [Hub #83](https://github.com/jimmie-potts/agent-device-hub/issues/83). Ordinary work retains this repository's SDLC; `plan-work` and `deliver-work` run only when explicitly invoked. Replace the obsolete delivery-skill reference and report guide synchronization, public publication and live verification separately.\n\nThe shared checkpoint baseline is agent-skills `ff80d247ea96a5d4c461d30a2c24148376197c7b`. No product behavior, OpenSpec delta, installation or physical-device change is involved. No skills were installed or copied. The branch incorporates current main's delivered CI scheduling changes.\n\n## Validation\n\nCandidate: `b49cb1eb7c86a603be1115deb82674408e1da0fc`.\n\n- Node 24 workflow validation, all ten workflow tests and whitespace checks passed.\n- [All 5 current-head CI jobs](https://github.com/jimmie-potts/divoom-app-upgrade/actions/runs/34480514308) passed.\n- Both independent review axes report no P0–P3 findings at the reconciled comparison. The instruction diff remains unchanged by the target merge.\n\n## Completion evidence\n\n- Source/tracker: open PR for Hub #83; source merge and main-CI readback remain pending.\n- Linked companions: [Hub #88](https://github.com/jimmie-potts/agent-device-hub/pull/88), currently open, owns the guide synchronization and architecture no-impact record.\n- Guide source: candidate prepared; current-candidate human guide approval and guarded merges remain pending.\n- Public publication/live verification: pending separately authorized publication and all nine route/hash checks. The public site has not changed.\n- Owner/next action: the Hub #83 coordinator completes the remaining review/acceptance and source-merge sequence, then reconciles actual post-merge facts.\n\n[Current delivery evidence and recovery steps](https://github.com/jimmie-potts/agent-device-hub/issues/83#issuecomment-5619269520) include all exact revisions, CI runs, reviews and remaining stages. The previous billing restriction did not block these runs.\n",
    "state": "open",
